        <figure>{% picture "projects/petchecker/home.png", "Finished PetChecker home page: a matching food banner with a large Go to Recommended Pet Food button, a bar chart of steps walked each day this week, and other dog food choices.", "(min-width: 48rem) 12rem, 40vw" %}<figcaption>Prototype</figcaption></figure>
